3. This port

   Name: FastFood Delight: Fabric Port
   Editions: Faithful Edition 1.2.1+mc1.17.1;
             Enhanced Edition 1.3.0+mc1.17.1
   Copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 CFood0112 (Fabric port and modifications).
   License: MIT License. See the LICENSE file.

   Modifications: Forge 1.19 to Fabric 1.17.1 port; registry namespace change
   to fastfooddelight_fabric; data and resource conversion; Fabric event and
   registration code; tag and recipe migration; a custom smelting serializer to
   preserve the 8-cheese output; waiter profession texture and trade-title
   fixes; stack-size and per-world village injection fixes; Simplified Chinese
   language file; and the Enhanced Edition changes listed in CHANGELOG.md.

